    "summon": "Retain a naturally obtained dune/seed/howler original source. Invest attack and survival HP in that source for original-source inheritance; goldob adjacent. Rattle source can lead to create real space. Keeper/incubator/pharaoh/matriarch compete for five actual positions; no inherited-child recursion assumption. Missing sources use combat bodies, no forced supply.",
    "frost": "Retain naturally obtained chaser/mage; train actual spell power there, not attack, stopping at current visible maximum enemy attack +2 chill dose; then support a second chill caster/scalable damage spell, leaving surplus unspent. Bench conduit once all owned chill casters meet that current threshold. Conduit adjacent to core and another chill caster when available. Protect with durable front; retain a real attack payoff/body directly behind its taunt, and meet its visible-threat HP floor; do not fill the team with control-only bodies; drake/keeper/queen/wyvern are competing payoffs. Attack points support scout then owned wyvern; legal sales refund the previous attack body training during this visible finisher transition and record lost permanent growth; current body is fallback; no source, no imaginary freeze combo.",
    "shared": "Only current visible shelf/offers and enemy threat; legal budgets, full history branches, no simulation selection. Shared SAP upgrade-offer buying/locking. No dependency on a unique general or six-tier.",
    "family": "frost"
  },
